{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kaichuu!","Tachikawa Tetsuya is a freshman at a new high school and he wants to become a great archer, like his late grandfather, Fudou.\n\n\nOne day, a new transfer student joins his class. In a surprise to everyone, it is a cute girl and not a guy like the rumors were saying... The name is Sasaki Gonzaburou, and... \"she\"... or maybe \"he\"... well, this person has some \"little\" secrets."],"ja":["カイチュー!",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-9205","ids":{"shikimori":9205,"mal":9205,"anilist":9205,"kodik":"serial-28914"},"kodikIds":["serial-28914"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28914":"2020-08-22T22:46:07Z"},"title":"В яблочко!","originalTitle":"Kaichuu!","alt":"Kaichu! カイチュー!","description":"Тэцуя Татикава — новичок в школе. Он хочет стать великим лучником, каким был его покойный дедушка Фудо. Однажды в его класс перевёлся новый ученик. Неожиданно для всех, новым учеником оказалась очень милая девушка, а вовсе не парень, как утверждали слухи. Её имя — Гондзабуро Сасаки . И имя это почему-то знакомо Тэцуе.","year":2010,"type":"ONA","genres":["сэйнэн","Комедия","Спорт","кроссдрессинг"],"rating":5.77,"popularity":2231,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/9205/5e37a2756710b93a86d6d9dd91dead1d.jpeg","width":225,"height":320},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/2cddd69c067cfdb355b7f86c8cba14978446c6f6.jpg","width":624,"height":350}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1391","dubId":"1391","label":"Кошка БесТиЯ & codevip","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-28914","translationId":"1391","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/709517/ca50cb168f942d92912fa5dd8e5fd639/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number"